# UI language

Every user-visible string is **English**: labels, tabs, buttons, empty states, errors, tooltips, and InfoTip copy.

- Do not add Portuguese (or any other language) to the UI.
- Parameter names follow the Boss RC-600 Parameter Guide in readable English (e.g. `Play Level`, `Loop Sync`).
- Keep RC0 XML tag letters (`A`–`Z`) in code only, never as the primary label.
- Comments in code may stay in English.
